SUMMARY:Sunday Pickin' with Mike Whitty & Friends
LOCATION:The Bay\, 24215 Hwy 331 S\, Santa Rosa Beach\, FL
DESCRIPTION:Sunday Pickin’ at The Bay features The Sand Ole’ Opry with 
